@* SPEC: docs/00-COMPONENTS/2.8/01-LipiTable-Spec.md §7 (column filters) — S3b typed filters *@
@* PHASE: 2.8 Data Display — Stage S3b (numeric/date/boolean/In filter editors) *@
@* DEMO: one table exercising every typed column filter; not redistributable (LiPi.Web). *@
@page "/admin/style-guide/data-display/table-filters"
@layout LiPi.Web.Components.Layouts.TopNavLayout
@rendermode InteractiveServer
@using LiPi.Components.DataDisplay
@using LiPicons.Blazor
@using System.Linq

<div class="sg-page">
    <div class="sg-header">
        <h1>Table Filters — S3b (typed)</h1>
        <p>
            One table, every filter type. Click the funnel on each header and try the operators:
            text columns (Name / Code) get contains / equals / starts-with / In; the Department and
            Status columns get In (multi-select); JoinedOn (Date) gets On / Before / After / Between
            plus relative operators (This month, Last quarter, Last N days, …); Monthly CTC (Currency)
            gets numeric operators incl. Between; Active (Boolean) gets Is true / Is false. Apply mode
            is the default (explicit Apply button); active filters show as chips below the toolbar.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="sg-section">
        <h2>All filter types in one table</h2>
        <p class="sg-note-p">
            Quick search is on too (search across text columns). Combine a quick search with one or
            more column filters — they AND together. Use the chip ✕ or the popover Clear to remove a
            single filter, or "Clear all" to reset.
        </p>

        <LipiTable TItem="DemoStaff" Items="@_staff" KeySelector="@(s => s.Id)" TableId="sg-filters-demo"
                   ShowQuickSearch="true" HighlightMatches="true">
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Name)" Header="Name" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.EmployeeCode)"
                        Header="Code" Type="ColumnType.Mono" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Department)"
                        Header="Department" Type="ColumnType.Status" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="DateOnly" Field="@(s => s.JoinedOn)"
                        Header="Joined" Type="ColumnType.Date" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="decimal" Field="@(s => s.MonthlyCtc)"
                        Header="Monthly CTC" Type="ColumnType.Currency" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="bool" Field="@(s => s.IsActive)"
                        Header="Active" Type="ColumnType.Boolean" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Status)"
                        Header="Status" Type="ColumnType.Status" />
        </LipiTable>
    </div>

    <div class="sg-section">
        <h2>Drawer mode — S3c (PR3)</h2>
        <p class="sg-note-p">
            The same columns and data with <code>FilterMode="FilterMode.Drawer"</code>. The per-column
            header funnels are replaced by a single <strong>Filters</strong> button in the toolbar (with an
            active-filter count badge); it opens a right-side drawer listing every filterable column. Edit any
            number of columns, then <strong>Apply</strong> commits them all at once and closes the drawer;
            <strong>Clear all</strong> resets every column and keeps the drawer open. Date columns keep their
            relative-date (A58) gating. Vary <code>FilterDrawerSide</code>, <code>FilterDrawerWidthPx</code>,
            and <code>FilterDrawerTrigger</code> to change side, width, and trigger style.
        </p>

        <LipiTable TItem="DemoStaff" Items="@_staff" KeySelector="@(s => s.Id)" TableId="sg-filters-drawer-demo"
                   ShowQuickSearch="true" HighlightMatches="true"
                   FilterMode="FilterMode.Drawer">
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Name)" Header="Name" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.EmployeeCode)"
                        Header="Code" Type="ColumnType.Mono" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Department)"
                        Header="Department" Type="ColumnType.Status" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="DateOnly" Field="@(s => s.JoinedOn)"
                        Header="Joined" Type="ColumnType.Date" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="decimal" Field="@(s => s.MonthlyCtc)"
                        Header="Monthly CTC" Type="ColumnType.Currency" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="bool" Field="@(s => s.IsActive)"
                        Header="Active" Type="ColumnType.Boolean" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Status)"
                        Header="Status" Type="ColumnType.Status" />
        </LipiTable>
    </div>

    <div class="sg-section">
        <h2>Drawer — Left side, 480px</h2>
        <p class="sg-note-p">Same drawer anchored on the <strong>left</strong> at a custom width: <code>FilterDrawerSide="FilterDrawerSide.Left"</code> + <code>FilterDrawerSizePx="480"</code>.</p>

        <LipiTable TItem="DemoStaff" Items="@_staff" KeySelector="@(s => s.Id)" TableId="sg-filters-drawer-left"
                   ShowQuickSearch="true" HighlightMatches="true"
                   FilterMode="FilterMode.Drawer"
                   FilterDrawerSide="FilterDrawerSide.Left" FilterDrawerSizePx="480">
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Name)" Header="Name" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.EmployeeCode)"
                        Header="Code" Type="ColumnType.Mono" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Department)"
                        Header="Department" Type="ColumnType.Status" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="DateOnly" Field="@(s => s.JoinedOn)"
                        Header="Joined" Type="ColumnType.Date" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="decimal" Field="@(s => s.MonthlyCtc)"
                        Header="Monthly CTC" Type="ColumnType.Currency" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="bool" Field="@(s => s.IsActive)"
                        Header="Active" Type="ColumnType.Boolean" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Status)"
                        Header="Status" Type="ColumnType.Status" />
        </LipiTable>
    </div>

    <div class="sg-section">
        <h2>Drawer — Top, 360px tall</h2>
        <p class="sg-note-p">Top placement; for Top/Bottom, <code>FilterDrawerSizePx</code> sets the drawer <strong>height</strong>: <code>FilterDrawerSide="FilterDrawerSide.Top"</code> + <code>FilterDrawerSizePx="360"</code>.</p>

        <LipiTable TItem="DemoStaff" Items="@_staff" KeySelector="@(s => s.Id)" TableId="sg-filters-drawer-top"
                   ShowQuickSearch="true" HighlightMatches="true"
                   FilterMode="FilterMode.Drawer"
                   FilterDrawerSide="FilterDrawerSide.Top" FilterDrawerSizePx="360">
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Name)" Header="Name" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.EmployeeCode)"
                        Header="Code" Type="ColumnType.Mono" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Department)"
                        Header="Department" Type="ColumnType.Status" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="DateOnly" Field="@(s => s.JoinedOn)"
                        Header="Joined" Type="ColumnType.Date" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="decimal" Field="@(s => s.MonthlyCtc)"
                        Header="Monthly CTC" Type="ColumnType.Currency" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="bool" Field="@(s => s.IsActive)"
                        Header="Active" Type="ColumnType.Boolean" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Status)"
                        Header="Status" Type="ColumnType.Status" />
        </LipiTable>
    </div>

    <div class="sg-section">
        <h2>Drawer — Bottom, 320px tall</h2>
        <p class="sg-note-p">Bottom placement at 320px height: <code>FilterDrawerSide="FilterDrawerSide.Bottom"</code> + <code>FilterDrawerSizePx="320"</code>.</p>

        <LipiTable TItem="DemoStaff" Items="@_staff" KeySelector="@(s => s.Id)" TableId="sg-filters-drawer-bottom"
                   ShowQuickSearch="true" HighlightMatches="true"
                   FilterMode="FilterMode.Drawer"
                   FilterDrawerSide="FilterDrawerSide.Bottom" FilterDrawerSizePx="320">
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Name)" Header="Name" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.EmployeeCode)"
                        Header="Code" Type="ColumnType.Mono" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Department)"
                        Header="Department" Type="ColumnType.Status" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="DateOnly" Field="@(s => s.JoinedOn)"
                        Header="Joined" Type="ColumnType.Date" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="decimal" Field="@(s => s.MonthlyCtc)"
                        Header="Monthly CTC" Type="ColumnType.Currency" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="bool" Field="@(s => s.IsActive)"
                        Header="Active" Type="ColumnType.Boolean" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Status)"
                        Header="Status" Type="ColumnType.Status" />
        </LipiTable>
    </div>

    <div class="sg-section">
        <h2>Drawer — wide 560px + funnel trigger</h2>
        <p class="sg-note-p">Right side at 560px with the compact funnel-icon trigger instead of the labelled button: <code>FilterDrawerSizePx="560"</code> + <code>FilterDrawerTrigger="FilterDrawerTrigger.HeaderFunnel"</code>.</p>

        <LipiTable TItem="DemoStaff" Items="@_staff" KeySelector="@(s => s.Id)" TableId="sg-filters-drawer-funnel"
                   ShowQuickSearch="true" HighlightMatches="true"
                   FilterMode="FilterMode.Drawer"
                   FilterDrawerSizePx="560" FilterDrawerTrigger="FilterDrawerTrigger.HeaderFunnel">
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Name)" Header="Name" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.EmployeeCode)"
                        Header="Code" Type="ColumnType.Mono" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Department)"
                        Header="Department" Type="ColumnType.Status" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="DateOnly" Field="@(s => s.JoinedOn)"
                        Header="Joined" Type="ColumnType.Date" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="decimal" Field="@(s => s.MonthlyCtc)"
                        Header="Monthly CTC" Type="ColumnType.Currency" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="bool" Field="@(s => s.IsActive)"
                        Header="Active" Type="ColumnType.Boolean" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Status)"
                        Header="Status" Type="ColumnType.Status" />
        </LipiTable>
    </div>

    <div class="sg-section">
        <h2>Independent calendar months</h2>
        <p class="sg-note-p">Drawer filter with <code>DateFilterIndependentMonths="true"</code>: open the
            <strong>Joined</strong> date filter and each calendar navigates on its own ‹ › — pick the start
            month on the left and a far-apart end month on the right. The right calendar is prevented from
            going earlier than the left. Default (omit the flag) keeps the linked consecutive pair.</p>

        <LipiTable TItem="DemoStaff" Items="@_staff" KeySelector="@(s => s.Id)" TableId="sg-filters-indep-months"
                   ShowQuickSearch="true" HighlightMatches="true"
                   FilterMode="FilterMode.Drawer"
                   DateFilterIndependentMonths="true">
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Name)" Header="Name" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.EmployeeCode)"
                        Header="Code" Type="ColumnType.Mono" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Department)"
                        Header="Department" Type="ColumnType.Status" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="DateOnly" Field="@(s => s.JoinedOn)"
                        Header="Joined" Type="ColumnType.Date" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="decimal" Field="@(s => s.MonthlyCtc)"
                        Header="Monthly CTC" Type="ColumnType.Currency" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="bool" Field="@(s => s.IsActive)"
                        Header="Active" Type="ColumnType.Boolean" />
            <LipiColumn TItem="DemoStaff" TValue="string" Field="@(s => s.Status)"
                        Header="Status" Type="ColumnType.Status" />
        </LipiTable>
    </div>

    <div class="sg-section">
        <h2>Notes</h2>
        <ul class="sg-notes">
            <li><code>OperatorsFor(ColumnType)</code> drives which operators each header offers — numeric,
                date (+relative), boolean, and In/Status sets.</li>
            <li>Date relative operators (This month, Last quarter, Last N days) resolve against the table's
                <code>FilterTimeZone</code> (defaults to server-local "today"); week operators use
                <code>FilterWeekStart</code>.</li>
            <li>The <code>In</code> editor lists the column's distinct values as checkboxes — the partial
                answer to multi-value OR (e.g. Department in Radiation Oncology + Medical Physics).</li>
            <li>Between uses both <code>Value</code> and <code>ValueEnd</code> on the descriptor.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

